-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- eDisjoint / aDisjoint
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- An empty geometry is a valid operand whose point set is empty, so every
-- relationship over it has the answer the library gives: disjoint true and
-- the rest false
